From 1cf8b26f129c2dd329257c688f02784de4791b92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ut-bitra <ut-bitra@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:22:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] arm64: dts: kona-v2.1: select project 21619 (realme GT
 Neo2, bitra)

The OPLUS ABL picks the base DTB by msm-id, board-id and oplus,dtsi_no.
On RMX3370 eight stock DTBs share msm-id <0x164 0x20001> and
board-id <0 0>; they differ only in oplus,dtsi_no, and the bootloader
selects the one carrying 0x5473 (21619). Without this value the ABL
will not match this base DTB on bitra.

Only kona-v2.1.dts is changed: it is the only kona base built from this
directory (as the overlay base), and bitra uses SoC revision v2.1.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/21623/kona-v2.1.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/21623/kona-v2.1.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/21623/kona-v2.1.dts
index 2ca9983df64f..1f37ab4b0883 100755
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/21623/kona-v2.1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/21623/kona-v2.1.dts
@@ -6,5 +6,5 @@
 	model = "Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. kona v2.1 SoC";
 	compatible = "qcom,kona";
 	qcom,board-id = <0 0>;
-	oplus,dtsi_no = <21623 21733>;
+	oplus,dtsi_no = <21619>;
 };
